274:Don't help her
275:Stop Ciri and persuade Shijukara.
276:Get Ciri to "educate" Shijukara
277:Pick up the food next to you and try to get close to the red-crowned crane.
278:Stand where you are and wait for Ciri to finish feeding the red-crowned crane.
279:Suggest that Ciri take the red-crowned crane to a nearby vet.
280:Suggest that Ciri take the red-crowned crane to a wildlife rescue agency.
